English.Info:
Multipeater can switch between three attack modes, allowing flexible allocation of firepower.

Damage: 20×6(or n)/1.5s
Special: Has three attack modes that can be switched by tapping on it; targeting behavior changes accordingly:
• 1. Standard Mode: Fires 2 peas each into his own lane and the 2 adjacent lanes;
• 2. Spread Mode: Fires 1 peas each into every lane (if the map has fewer than 6 lanes, the damage from missing shots is evenly redistributed among the remaining shots);
• 3. Focus Mode: Fires 6 peas each into his own lane.

Torchthree turns incoming projectiles into flaming peas and splits them across multiple lanes!

Special: 
Ignites peas:
• 1st ignition is exactly like Torchwood;
• 2nd ignition splits into two peas on the rows above and below;
• 3rd ignition splits into three peas across all three rows;
• The cycle repeats.
